   "fieldtype": "HTML",
   "options": "<p class=\"text-muted small\">To find the certificate ID, run on the server:</p><pre style=\"font-size:12px;\">pkcs11-tool --module /opt/hypersecu/libcastle_v2.so.1.0.0 -O</pre><p class=\"text-muted small\">Copy the <b>ID</b> value of the certificate issued in your name (not the CA chain certificates) into Certificate ID above. The USB token must stay plugged into the server for signing to work.</p>"
